  <result aggregation-status="0" type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 3.1. Increased capacity of Member States to formulate and implement national employment policies in response to the COVID-19 crisis</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">In December 2023, the Ministry of Labour of Oman drafted, finalised and submitted to the Cabinet for adoption the National Employment Policy and action plan, which was developed through tripartite consultations, with the aim to improve the employment and labour market situation in the Sultanate. Further to the NEP formulation capacity building activity organized by the ILO and the employment diagnostic undertaken in the previous biennium, a capacity building activity on implementation mechanisms of the NEP was organized by the ILO and ITCILO between 14 and 17 November 2022 to support the government and social partners and build their capacities for the effective implementation of the policy once adopted.</narrative>
   </description>
